      "decision": "accepted",
      "scope": "candidate planning only",
      "reason": "Team 1→2→3 versions add then remove a peer without changing Agent identity or Governance Policy. Removed and Policy-unlisted registered peers still propose and exchange messages; Manager text does not confer human power.",
      "evidence_labels": [
        "m3_suite",
        "independent_probes_v2",
        "readonly_demo_v2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "criterion": "Blueprint 和 DAG 有版本与循环校验",
      "decision": "accepted",
      "scope": "candidate planning only",
      "reason": "All nine demo candidate digests/supersedes chains and old versions survive every prefix. Blueprint DAG versions 1–5 have deterministic edges/layers; cycle, stale-base, reference and source tampering are rejected. Two-process tests cover the final writer boundary.",
      "evidence_labels": [
        "m3_suite",
        "independent_probes_v2",
        "readonly_demo_v2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "criterion": "提案不要求 Manager 许可",
      "decision": "accepted",
      "scope": "candidate planning only",
      "reason": "Two peers independently propose without Manager permission or an author Task Lease. Peer proposes recovery, retains Change Request access after Team removal, and gains no execution authority from a proposal.",
      "evidence_labels": [
        "m3_suite",
        "independent_probes_v2",
        "readonly_demo_v2"
      ]
    }
  ],
